                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How is Mumbai's skincare ecosystem different from Delhi + Bengaluru?</h3>
                                        <p>Mumbai = largest D2C concentration + trend-aware buyer + Marathi + Gujarati multilingual. Delhi = North India wedding + festive + men's + Punjabi + NRI diaspora + Winter peak. Bengaluru = VC-backed startup + tech-native + LTV/CAC-driven + Kannada + Telugu regional.</p>
                                        <h3>Do we need a Mumbai-based agency or does remote work?</h3>
                                        <p>Hybrid (Mumbai HQ + remote execution pod) winning model. Local strategist + monthly in-person QBR + on-site shoots + creator sourcing + remote performance + SEO + content for daily execution. Pure remote works for smaller D2C; pure local can lack execution scale.</p>
                                        <h3>What languages should Mumbai + Delhi + Bengaluru skincare creative use?</h3>
                                        <p>Mumbai: English + Hindi + Marathi + Gujarati. Delhi: English + Hindi + Punjabi. Bengaluru: English + Hindi + Kannada + Telugu. Multilingual outperforms English-only by 25-40% on cost + engagement for local + regional catchment.</p>
                                        <h3>How much do Mumbai + Delhi + Bengaluru skincare agencies cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 65K-1.5L Starter. Rs 1.5-3.5L Growth. Rs 4L+ Enterprise. Mumbai + Delhi + Bengaluru talent may add 5-15% to remote-agency-equivalent pricing.</p>
                                        <h3>Should Gurugram VC-backed startups need different agency capability?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes: LTV/CAC/payback/cohort reporting + rapid iteration + Shopify + headless architecture + attribution transparency + founder-founder access + Board-prep quarterly. Different from Mumbai + Delhi bootstrapped brand needs.</p>
                                        <h3>Which Mumbai/Delhi/Bengaluru skincare brands has ITD worked with?</h3>
                                        <p>Client references available under NDA on discovery. 4+ published case study analyses (Kama Ayurveda + Plum + Sugar + WOW Skin Science). Full portfolio review on Calendly discovery call.</p>
                                        <h3>What are city-specific compliance considerations?</h3>
                                        <p>Mumbai: Maharashtra FDA. Delhi: Delhi FDA. Bengaluru: Karnataka FDA. Additional: local advertising + regulatory + retail-partnership rules. All in addition to CDSCO national + BIS SPF.</p>
